{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Do not imagine.</b> תחשבי from the same stem as כאשר דמיתי, and both from the root דמיון, in the mind's thought. The tsadi has a dagesh, and הצלה is defective due to the missing nun of the root, and the sense is that relief and deliverance will arise for the Jews from another path and not through you — and if you imagine you will escape, you will perish, and all your father's house with you."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:57.657327435Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}